                "text": "The claim that OB3 will \u201cdevastate\u201d rural hospitals is simply FALSE.  This talking point has been heavily pushed by hospital lobbyists whose top priority is maximizing federal handouts. Let me set the record straight. \n\nRural hospitals receive only 1.3% of Medicaid spending. Furthermore, these facilities were largely exempt from cuts to the program.\n\nFinally, thanks to the law's $50 billion rural hospital fund, these hospitals might almost double their annual Medicaid revenues.",
