                "retweet_count": 69,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The leftist media\u2019s coverage of my visit with President Trump is exactly why Americans don\u2019t trust the mainstream media \u2013 distorting a patriotic gesture into petty personal attack against @POTUS.  \n\nThis wasn\u2019t a so-called \u201cconfused blanket moment\u201d \u2013 it was the proud presentation of an American flag blanket, handcrafted by a Tennessee constituent, meant to honor the leader of the free world for policies that have strengthened communities across Tennessee and beyond. \n\nAnd I won\u2019t stand by quietly while dishonest outlets spread lies to score cheap political points. Tennesseans deserve better, and I will always make sure their voices are heard above the noise.",
