                "retweet_count": 54,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Democrats are lying about Obamacare, so I called them out on CNN:\n\n1) Premiums are increasing because the Democrats' Un-Affordable Care Act is bad policy and it is unsustainable.\n\n2) Premiums are increasing because Congressional Democrats passed a law which included a 2026 expiration for COVID-19 subsidies.\n\n3) These subsidies benefit just 7% of Americans, yet all Americans are suffering with higher costs because of Obamacare.\n\n4) Americans earning 133%\u2013400% above the poverty line keep their subsidies in 2026. That\u2019s already permanent law and Democrats know it.\n\n5) Democrats shut down the government because they wanted to hand $40 billion in subsidies to big insurance companies, not American families.",
