                "retweet_count": 556,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Let\u2019s set the record straight on Biden\u2019s COVID-era Obamacare subsidies:\n\n1) These expiring subsidies benefit just 7% of Americans, yet all Americans are suffering with higher costs because of Obamacare.\n\n2) Premiums are increasing regardless of whether these subsidies are extended, because Obamacare is bad policy and unsustainable. Premiums have already increased 221% from 2013 to 2025.\n\n3) Biden\u2019s COVID-era Obamacare subsidies don\u2019t go to patients, they go straight to insurance companies \u2014 even for people making up to $400,000 a year.\n\n4) Remember Democrats passed these subsidies twice, and extended them again. They set the expiration date. And they created the entire FAILED Obamacare system.",
