                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Remember when Obama said you could keep your doctor and your premiums would drop $2,500? He lied. And 15years later, the Democrats are lying again about \u201clowering healthcare costs.\u201d\n\nTheir plan isn\u2019t cheaper care, it\u2019s more federal subsidies. That\u2019s how we got $38.4 trillion in debt and a broken healthcare system.\n\nWe should NEVER deficit spend billions on Obamacare. Ever.",
